  "title": "Justin and Christine's Hurricane Pork",
  "description": "A pork tenderloin and a bag of carrots transform into a tasty, savory main dish after simmering for hours in the slow cooker with ginger ale, curry, and maple syrup. Serve with white or curried rice.",
